<title>JAPAN: BOE's Davies says sterling too high vs mark - Jiji.</title>
<headline>BOE's Davies says sterling too high vs mark - Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling is slightly too high against the mark, Bank of England Deputy Governor Howard Davies was quoted as saying by Jiji news agency on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
